  "title": "Crispy, Spicy Cauliflower Pancakes",
  "description": "Combining grated, sauteed cauliflower, egg whites, and cottage cheese, these crispy, spicy paleo pancakes are easy to bake in a muffin tin.",
  "authors": [
    "LusciousMuffins"
  ],
